===============================================================================
Required mods (interoperation only)
===============================================================================

This mod is useless on its own. At runtime it calls the public script APIs of
two third-party mods, which server owners install separately from their
original sources. Neither is redistributed here, and no code from either is
copied into this repository.

GameLabs (CFTools Cloud)
  Copyright (c) CFTools Software GmbH
  Source: https://github.com/CFToolsCloud/gamelabs-plugin-dayz
  Used API: GameLabsContextAction, GameLabsActionContext,
            GameLabsActionParameter, GetGameLabs(), MissionServer's
            GLActionRegisterHook(), RegisterVehicle()/RemoveVehicle()
  Guarded by the preprocessor define GAMELABS. Without GameLabs installed,
  this mod compiles and loads, but registers nothing.

DayZ Expansion
  Copyright (c) DayZ Expansion Mod Team
  Source: https://github.com/salutesh/DayZ-Expansion-Scripts
  License of the original work: CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
  Used API: ExpansionVehicle.Get(), ForceUnlock(), SetLockState(),
            GetLockState(), HasKey(), AssignOwner(), and the enum
            ExpansionVehicleLockState
  Guarded by the preprocessor define EXPANSIONMODVEHICLE.

  Note on CC BY-NC-ND: the NoDerivatives term restricts distributing modified
  copies of Expansion. This mod distributes no Expansion code and modifies no
  Expansion file. It only calls documented script entry points at runtime, the
  same way any other server-side mod does.

